{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>梵蒂岡教廷公開教宗良十四世接受肺癌手術後的首批照片。</p><p></p><p>教廷周五公開圖片，指確診肺腺癌的良十四世在傑梅利醫院切除部分肺葉後，他身穿祭衣親自主持彌撒。教廷指良十四世接受血液檢查及拍攝胸部X光片，顯示其健康狀況有好轉，可完全如常活動。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"VAT.POPE-0100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PBe6xn1od01792188128.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p><br/>梵蒂岡表示，良十四世又與俄羅斯總統普京通電話，提到關注烏克蘭南部赫爾松的人道危機，促請俄方停火，以便向當地運送糧食及醫療等援助物資。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VAT.POPE 0100 upd1008.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026evlor27i8e1792204778.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T02:58:41.905835+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T02:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T05:37:44.954399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T02:57:35.680313+00:00","content_hash":"3df80c891026fae3c2d25189ecf68d5699281591614e8021eac1f52f9d51cbfd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}